tter if they're  saints or [ __ ] they're your people  they watch your back and you watch  theirs or you've got nothing here he has  his epiphany deciding to go back to the  ship right after he hits the brothel  again and there we see the clip i played  at the beginning of the video play out  elsewhere on the station now that joseph  had his new limb removed he tells  drummer he's sorry the fight's not over  and he can't help her anymore as he  passes back out michio tells her that  she'll stay there with him drummer is  opposed to the idea because the inners  control the station emichio makes the  distinction that they're leaving they'll  put up with the inners on the station  because they know she'll never give up  the fight with marco now and they really  can't help her drummer says that she  never loved them because they were  fighters she loved them because they  were builders and she hoped to build  something together and she walks away  feeling the weight of the decisions  she's made on the way back to the ship  she arrives at a checkpoint and even  though she doesn't want to skip the line  she's encouraged to do so because she's  pre-cleared on the way she passes saint  drani who takes a video asking how it  feels to be the inner's favorite pet and  if that's not enough when she returns to  the tynan she finds naomi waiting for  her she does apologize for just dropping  in and says it's good to see her naomi  compliments her on her ship and says  that she wants to meet her family  drummer explains that they're all gone  now somewhat brutally she explains that  oxana and berthold left after she turned  on the free navy to save the rasanante  serge was executed and now michio and  joseph have decided to stay on siri so  they don't have to continue to pay for  the choices she's made they have an  emotional back and forth where naomi  somewhat apologizes and drummer seeing  through it asking why she really came  there at first she says i wanted to see  you and she gets the quick response you  know me well enough to know that silence  meant i didn't want to be seen she gets  to the truth saying that holden asked  her to talk to her for abasarala she  wants them to fight by her side against  marco and you see drummer's face drop as  she's listening and she turns around  saying you should leave you come to me  running errands for the inners it gets  heated as drummer asks her how she can  choose their side naomi says she chose  her own side and that gets a quick  rebuttal that avasarala and our people  are no better than marco everything else  aside drummer's choices are down to  waiting for the bounty to go high enough  that someone will kill her her family is  already gone or in her words she can put  a collar around her neck and hand the  enters the leash she feels like there's  no place in this universe for her and  neither one of them can envision a  different way to move forward naomi says  all we can do now is stand by the people  we love what else is there and this is a  little bit tone deaf and drummer says  [ __ ] you you self-righteous [ __ ] but  faced with the inevitable she starts to  cry and they hold each other  from there we see avasarala moving  through the station on foot she comes  around the corner in dramatic fashion  and comes face to face with drummer in  public out in the open where everyone  can see drummer didn't believe she would  actually follow through on leaving her  ship so on some level this has impressed  her but she makes the point that the  system is filled with the graves of  belters who trusted inners avasarala  fires back that her planet is now  covered with the bodies of people who  paid the price for that she's confident  that marco will get a lot more belters  killed before this is over and she needs  drummer to help her bring it to an end  the sooner it's done the fewer people  will die on both sides kamina asks if  she'll remember the belters who died for  her victory after marco is dead she can  only promise she will and that she's  given belters plenty of reasons to hate  her but none to think that she's a liar  even though neither of them thought they  would see the day that belters would be  fighting alongside inners against other  belters they shake hands to form a union  and the episode ends there i think what  impressed me most about this episode was  that it had to explain a lot of things  in dialogue for everything to make sense  heading into the finale but i thought  they did a masterful job in balancing  things out with such great emotional  interactions between characters at  different points in the episode they  made the choice to hold back what marco  was really up to that his master plan  shifted to him setting up shop behind  the rail guns and being in a position  where he had resources and the means to  build his own fleet to rival the others  in the system i thought the way that  they introduced the guns worked and even  though carino paid the ultimate price  it's one of those situations where the  information they gathered was vital  since that was going to happen to  someone the free navy got all of the  materials and the guns from the laconia  gate so it seems like they were able to  fortify the ring space in secret  drummer's statement to avasarala about  the inner's behavior making marco  inevitable is really important and i  think they did a fair job of presenting  where she was coming from i guess it  gets easy to overlook because the short  season requires her to rethink this core  belief in the same episode but it's key  that no one on the inner side of things  really tries to dispute her claims the  grievances she has and the belt in  general have are legitimate and that  makes things complicated even when  violent extremists follow through with  the massive terrorist attack on earth i  think it goes without saying that where  this episode really excels is in the two  characters in a room talking to each  other department and it just had so many  emotionally charged exchanges that it's  crazy that they all happened in one  episode the way that amos is working  through the balance between thinking  holden was trying to get them killed and  saving the entire human race was perfect  and the whole interaction between him  and bobby was a highlight reel it's a  fitting end to his internal conflict  about what he's doing out there because  they have been through too much to throw  it all away at this point over one  decision and as the x-ray episode points  out holden never really went looking to  be in the middle of everything in the  first place the naomi and drummer  reunion was definitely the hardest  hitting in the season and possibly the  series and there's so much history to  keep track of i think here is where the  x-ray episodes really added to the  experience you have to think back to the  end of last season and everything that  led up to drummer turning against the  free navy and what it cost her in the  end she essentially did that because of  naomi and when she's backed into a  corner here she brings that up that it's  all tied back to those feelings so when  naomi tells her that the only thing left  to do is fight for the people you love  she knows that's the truth but it's  still a bitter pill to swallow and there  is a ton more to get into and i could  talk about this forever and we'll try to  do that when we get into the live stream  in the next couple of days there were a  couple of things that sat wrong with me  as a book reader the first time i  watched this even though i love the lb  character she's one of my favorite povs  in the books i felt a little  disappointed that it felt like it was  her that figured out what was going on  at the ring gates rather than naomi and  a couple of other small things jumped  out but they didn't take away from the  overall experience of watching the  episode and on re-watch it made a lot  more sense i think that we're in a good  place to leave this one so let me know  in the comments what you thought about  the episode how you're feeling about  things going in the table is pretty set  up i feel like there's probably anxiety  going around for show only people but  they're hitting the character beats and  things are unfolding so just hang in  there please like this video if you  enjoyed it please subscribe to my  channel if you haven't already and  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

